ess prepaid and credit card. In addition, it offers savings and investing solutions, including Money Boxes, a solution for goal-based investing; investing solutions, an attractive investment product with customized and conflict-free guidance; and NuCrypto, a solution for buying and selling cryptocurrencies through the Nu app. Further, the company provides borrowing solutions comprising personal unsecured and secured loans; Pix financing that enables credit card and digital account customers to make free and instant peer-to-peer transfers; Boleto financing, which enables credit card and digital account customers to make payments; purchase financing; cash-in financing; and NuPay to make online purchases and pay for services through Nu app. Additionally, it offers protection solutions, such as NuInsurance protection solutions, including life, mobile, auto, home, and financial protection insurance policies; and beyond financial services solutions, including NuTravel, a travel portal; and NuCel, a mobile phone service. Nu Holdings Ltd. was founded in 2013 and is based in Sao Paulo, Brazil.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"6199","sic_desc":"Finance Services","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","mcap":64876150784,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"SAO PAULO, SP, Brazil","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1691493,"state_inc":"E9","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.1139,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":null,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":2509867000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.13,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":636838000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":25.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":